==Battleground==
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Dead Donny Dash]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Dead Donny Dash]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is quite simple if you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]]. All you need to do is kill the first few Doge Darks and then deploy Awakened Bahamut and watch the fun. Director Kurosawah and Dead Donny Dash are all unbuffed and combined with each of their respective weaknesses, a long TBA, and a blindspot allows Awakened Bahamut to defeat them with ease. Like the previous stage, [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat/Pizza Cat]] can be of use if you are struggling with the Dark enemies.

